# fp6 KV scales (the AWQ calibration, shared with AWQ_MJOLNIR_E2M3) plus
# VocabTrim: the drafter's logits restricted to the 64K most frequent target
# tokens (kv_scales/draft_vocab-awq.json, calibrated on this checkpoint).
MJOLNIR_ATTN_KV_SCALES={configs}/kv_scales/e2m3-awq.json
MJOLNIR_DRAFT_VOCAB={configs}/kv_scales/draft_vocab-awq.json
MJOLNIR_DRAFT_VOCAB_SIZE=65536